<title>UK: CRICKET-MIDDLESEX 305 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MIDDLESEX 305 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Middlesex were all out for 305 at the close on the opening of their three-day match against Australia at Lord's on Saturday.</p>
